tor:Name or object path)"},"enabled":{"type":"boolean","description":"true to simulate, false to stop.","default":true}},"required":["target"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"returnValue":{"type":"object","title":"PhysicsToolSimulateResult","properties":{"target":{"type":"string","description":"Reference of the owning actor."},"simulating":{"type":"boolean"},"mobility_changed":{"type":"boolean","description":"True when the component was Static/Stationary and was switched to Movable to simulate (undo restores it)."},"note":{"type":"string","description":"Extra information (e.g. what changed besides simulation)."}},"description":"{target, simulating, mobility_changed, note}. Fails if the component has no collision (physics cannot simulate without it)."}},"required":["returnValue"]},"undoable":true,"irreversible":false,"requires_world":true,"async":false}]},"level":{"name":"level","version":"2.0.0","description":"Levels and content of the running game: streaming levels, level instances, World Partition data layers, map travel and\na search over the cooked asset registry.\nWorkflow: find_assets (asset_class World) to discover maps -> list_levels / get_current_level -> load_level_instance\n(streams a map in at a transform; undo unloads it) -> set_level_visibility / unload_level / set_data_layer.\nopen_level replaces the whole world and ends all undo history.","tools":[{"name":"find_assets","function":"FindAssets","description":"Searches the cooked asset registry for assets (maps, meshes, materials, input actions, ...). Only assets packaged with the build are found. Per-actor packages (__ExternalActors__) are skipped.\nReturns: Total matches and the assets {path, package, class}, sorted by path. Fails if folder_path does not start with \"/\" or the class is unknown.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"folder_path":{"type":"string","description":"Folder to search, e.g. \"/Game/Maps\"; empty = /Game and every plugin content root.","default":""},"name":{"type":"string","description":"Only assets whose name contains this text (case-insensitive), e.g. \"Sandbox\".","default":""},"asset_class":{"type":"string","description":"Only assets of this class or a subclass, e.g. \"World\" for maps, \"StaticMesh\", \"InputAction\". (Class name or path (a Object))"},"recursive":{"type":"boolean","description":"Also search sub-folders.","default":true},"limit":{"type":"integer","description":"Maximum results (0 = default list limit).","default":0}},"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"returnValue":{"type":"object","title":"LevelToolAssetSearch","properties":{"total":{"type":"integer","description":"Matches before the limit."},"assets":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","title":"LevelToolAssetInfo","properties":{"path":{"type":"string","description":"Object path, e.g. \"/Game/Maps/Sandbox.Sandbox\" (pass it to tools that take an asset)."},"package":{"type":"string","description":"Package path, e.g. \"/Game/Maps/Sandbox\" (what load_level_instance / open_level take for maps)."},"class":{"type":"string","description":"Asset class, e.g. \"World\", \"StaticMesh\", \"InputAction\"."}}},"description":"Matches sorted by path, at most `limit`."}},"description":"Total matches and the assets {path, package, class}, sorted by path. Fails if folder_path does not start with \"/\" or the class is unknown."}},"required":["returnValue"]},"undoable":false,"irreversible":false,"requires_world":false,"async":false},{"name":"get_current_level","function":"GetCurrentLevel","description":"Returns the package path of the loaded map (the persistent level), e.g. \"/Game/Maps/Main\".","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{},"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"returnValue":{"type":"string"}},"required":["returnValue"]},"undoable":false,"irreversible":false,"requires_world":true,"async":false},{"name":"list_levels","function":"ListLevels")RTD"),
	TEXT(R"RTD(,"description":"Lists the persistent level, streaming levels and level instances (loaded/visible state) and data layer states.\nReturns: {persistent, streaming:[{name, package, loaded, visible, should_be_loaded, should_be_visible, instance}], data_layers:{name: state}}.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{},"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"returnValue":{"type":"object","title":"LevelToolLevels","properties":{"persistent":{"type":"string","description":"Package of the persistent level, e.g. \"/Game/Maps/Main\"."},"streaming":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","title":"LevelToolStreamingInfo","properties":{"name":{"type":"string","description":"Short name, e.g. \"Sandbox\" (pass it as `level`)."},"package":{"type":"string","description":"Package path, e.g. \"/Game/Maps/Sandbox\" (or the instance's unique package)."},"loaded":{"type":"boolean"},"visible":{"type":"boolean"},"should_be_loaded":{"type":"boolean","description":"Requested state (streaming catches up over the next frames)."},"should_be_visible":{"type":"boolean"},"instance":{"type":"boolean","description":"Loaded by load_level_instance (a dynamic level instance)."}}},"description":"Streaming levels and level instances, in the world's order."},"data_layers":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{"type":"string","enum":["Unloaded","Loaded","Activated"]},"description":"World Partition data layers: short name -> Unloaded / Loaded / Activated (empty without World Partition)."}},"description":"{persistent, streaming:[{name, package, loaded, visible, should_be_loaded, should_be_visible, instance}], data_layers:{name: state}}."}},"required":["returnValue"]},"undoable":false,"irreversible":false,"requires_world":true,"async":false},{"name":"load_level_instance","function":"LoadLevelInstance","description":"Streams a map in as a level instance at a transform and completes when it is loaded and visible. Undoable (undo unloads it).\nReturns: {le